    "description": "<p>When you <strong>hit one or more creatures with an Attack, Offensive Spell, or a similar ability</strong>, you may set <strong>one</strong> of them as your <em><strong>Attack Chain</strong></em> target. You may only have one <em><strong>Attack Chain</strong></em> target at a time, and lose it at the end of the scene.</p><p>Whenever you are about to perform <strong>any sort of Check against your </strong><em><strong>Attack Chain</strong></em> target, clear your <em><strong>Attack Chain</strong></em> and gain a <strong>+1</strong> to your Check.</p>",
